# Visionfy Demo Overview

- Repository contains a Next.js frontend and a Python Flask backend.
- Frontend lives in `frontend/` and is hosted on Firebase App Hosting.
- Backend lives in `backend/src/` and is deployed to Google Cloud Run.

## Where to look first

- Frontend UI/logic: `frontend/app/`, `frontend/components/`, `frontend/services/`.
- Backend API entrypoint: `backend/src/main.py`, endpoints under `backend/src/api/`.
- Static assets for backend demo: `backend/src/static/`.

## Deployment pointers

- Frontend deploy: see `FRONT_DEPLOY.md` and `firebase.json`.
- Backend deploy: see `backend/DEPLOY.md` and `backend/DOCKER.md`.
